OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt Sue's canine-friendly Seashells
OL,7,     FGuesthouse in Great Yarmouth, the
OL,8,     Fcontroversial issues of allowing
OL,9,     Fdogs to sleep in the beds and
OL,10,     Fguests to smoke in the bedrooms
OL,11,     Fcause tensions to rise.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe converted prison cell rooms at
OL,14,     FThe Old Court Guesthouse in Bath
OL,15,     Fleave one claustrophobic guest
OL,16,     Ffeeling caged, so host Nancy
OL,17,     Forganises a historical tour and a
OL,18,     Fdip in a thermal spa.
