OL,5,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAt The Dean B&B in East Lothian,
OL,7,     FCaroline's gardens and
OL,8,     Fbreathtaking views across the
OL,9,     FFirth of Forth impress her guests.
OL,10,     FBut a fine dining experience
OL,11,     Fleaves some of them hungry for
OL,12,     Fmore.
OL,13,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,14,     FIt's the final day and the B&Bers
OL,15,     Fmeet for one last time to thrash
OL,16,     Fout their feedback, reveal the
OL,17,     Fpayments and find out which
OL,18,     Festablishment has been crowned the
OL,19,     Fbest value B&B of the week.
